==French==

===Pronunciation===
*[[w:IPA|IPA]]: /pʁɔ.mɛtʁ/
*[[w:SAMPA|SAMPA]]: /pRO.mEtR/

===Verb===
'''promettre'''

# to [[promise]]
#: ''Je te '''promets''' que je te rendrai ton argent avant dimanche.'' ({{checktransex|I pledge I'll give you your money back before sunday.|French}})
# {{cattag|intransitive}} to be [[promising]], to be [[hopeful]].
#: ''C'est une athlète qui '''promet'''.'' ({{checktransex|She is a promising athlete.|French}})

